@host = http://localhost:5101
@conta = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@token = <cole o access_token obtido no Keycloak>

### Saldo agora
GET {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/saldo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saldo em um instante
GET {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/saldo?em=2026-09-01T12:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consolidado do dia (UTC)
GET {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/saldo-diario/2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
